            <ArticleTitle>Hot Topics in Primary Care: Individualizing Inhaled Medications for Asthma and Allergic Rhinitis.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>S71-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">jfp_6412z</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Inhaled medications are important treatment options for asthma and allergic rhinitis. Selecting among the different formulations and delivery devices is important as it impacts adherence and proper use, both of which affect health-related outcomes. The wide variety of inhalers now available allows individualizing inhaler selection.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
